/*
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    zealgt on hazel with Apptainer images instead of the conda prefixes (docs/PLAN_containers.md §5 step 1)
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Profile `apptainer_hazel`, after `hazel` (and `short` / `normal`): -profile hazel,apptainer_hazel[,short|normal|stub].
    Slurm settings are hazel's, unchanged. Images are never pulled at task time (compute nodes are offline, NXF_OFFLINE=true):
    every SIF is downloaded beforehand into cacheDir by an xfer job (PLAN §5 step 3); a missing one fails the task.
    The apptainer binary (/usr/local/apps/apptainer/1.4.2-1/bin) is put on PATH by scripts/submit_head_job.sbatch and
    exported by Slurm to every task job (the site module is not used: it fails when TMPDIR is unset).
    Binds: /share/maize/frodrig4 (work/, TMPDIR, FASTQ checkpoint) and /rsstu/users/r/rrellan/BZea (store, results, raw data;
    BZea, not ZEAL: ZEAL/reference/B73.fa links to ../../ref/).
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*/
conda.enabled        = false
apptainer {
    enabled    = true
    autoMounts = true
    cacheDir   = '/share/maize/frodrig4/apptainer/cache'
    runOptions = '-B /share/maize/frodrig4,/rsstu/users/r/rrellan/BZea'
}
